# Cloudflare Workers static-assets headers.

# Security headers on every response (added 2026-09-19 after an SEO audit found
# none were being sent). Deliberately NOT included:
#  - Content-Security-Policy: a strict CSP would block Google AdSense, GA4 and
#    the ad iframes; getting one right for Auto Ads needs its own careful pass.
#  - HSTS `includeSubDomains` / `preload`: both are hard to undo, and
#    includeSubDomains would also bind tools.eventrentalcosts.com. Plain
#    max-age is safe now that HTTP -> HTTPS is forced at the edge.
#  - Permissions-Policy: AdSense uses browser features (e.g. topics/attribution)
#    that a restrictive policy can silently disable.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# /_astro/* files are content-hashed by the build — safe to cache forever.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
